(2607, 221, 'flexible_content_blocks_2_block_content', 'We only work with the best. So when you’re in our pool, you’ll swim with some of the most talented creatives around. Plus, we empower you to drive your career on your terms - from rates, to work hours, to preferred projects. Here at Sandy, we’ve always got your back.'),
(2608, 221, '_flexible_content_blocks_2_block_content', 'field_5c1ac8069a384'),
