(12058, 10871, '_oembed_time_fad37579422767f235347f32d728d9aa', '1620692682'),
(12059, 10871, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'Over the last few years, corporations around the world have finally warmed up to the idea that diversity in the workplace is important. What once was something simply relegated to HR is now sometimes a whole department at Fortune 500 companies, and it’s a beautiful thing to see. The trick here is of course selling everyone on the idea that diversity isn’t just important because everyone deserves a seat at the table- it’s also just plain, old good business sense.'),
