(12386, 10998, '_wp_old_slug', 'Hindsight is 20/20'),
(12387, 10998, '_wp_old_slug', 'Sandy x Freelance Founders: Portfoli-WHOA Freelance Portfolio Workshop'),
(12388, 10998, '_oembed_fad37579422767f235347f32d728d9aa', '<iframe title="FFxSANDY_PortfoliWoah-Rae" src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/523943801?dnt=1&amp;app_id=122963" width="1080" height="608" frameborder="0" allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>'),
(12389, 10998, '_oembed_time_fad37579422767f235347f32d728d9aa', '1620692682'),
(12390, 10998, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'Team building is an absolutely vital ingredient to any team’s success, and it’s not just because we want our reports or team members to get along and to know each other better. Indeed, those are two important aspects of why team building is important. But there are so many other reasons why building a foundation for fostering community among team members is necessary for success. For one, it makes team members feel valued. While we already kind of already knew that, it’s important to point out that making a team member feel valued is likely going to make them happier, and we all know happiness can lead to a better work end product.'),
