(13874, 11719, 'flexible_content_blocks_3_block_heading', 'The right people for <br>the right roles'),
(13875, 11719, '_flexible_content_blocks_3_block_heading', 'field_663a2107caa6c'),
(13876, 11719, 'flexible_content_blocks_3_block_content', 'Navigating the landscape of creative and marketing roles can be complex, but we’re here to simplify things for all our clients. Having spent many years building teams with top-tier brands and agencies, we’ve got the skills to help you navigate the terrain and identify the roles best suited to your team and goals.'),
