(23334, 11907, 'flexible_content_blocks_2_slides_0_slide_content', '<h3><b>Roles Fit For You</b></h3>\r\n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Our Elastic Teams offer a wide range of opportunities in our network. We work with you to find roles that align with your skills and expertise.</span>'),
