(24710, 11926, 'flexible_content_blocks_5_testimonials_0_testimonial', 'Sandy\'s flexible resource approach was great! It allowed us to get talented artists in-house in a short amount of time and deliver content for far less than it would have cost us to work with a separate production house'),
