(26360, 59, '_flexible_content_blocks_3_block_heading', 'field_663a294fa32b0'),
(26361, 59, 'flexible_content_blocks_3_block_content', '<span style="font-weight: 400;">We’re a team of agency vets and creative leaders who develop simple, intelligent AI-ready staffing solutions. We work tirelessly to solve the challenges of finding and managing creative talent, so you can focus on getting the job done right. Here’s a closer look at why our partners work with us:</span>'),
