(27591, 12101, 'flexible_content_blocks_2_slides_0_slide_content', '<h3>Innovative Talent Solutions</h3>\r\nWith cutting-edge strategies and smarter resourcing capabilities, we offer next-level recruiting and team management solutions.'),
