(28104, 12104, '_flexible_content_blocks_2_block_eyebrow', 'field_5c1ac7d89a382'),
(28105, 12104, 'flexible_content_blocks_2_block_heading', 'Our Story'),
(28106, 12104, '_flexible_content_blocks_2_block_heading', 'field_5c1ac7ff9a383'),
(28107, 12104, 'flexible_content_blocks_2_block_content', 'In 2019, we saw a transformation in the modern workspace and came up with an idea: let’s make it way easier for companies to find and manage talent with an Elastic Team solution.\r\n\r\nSince then, we’ve:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Established a skilled community of 5,000+ creatives–all vetted for experience and excellence</li>\r\n 	<li>Earned a spot on the coveted Inc. 5000 list</li>\r\n 	<li>Built highly successful teams for organizations ranging from startups to enterprise-level</li>\r\n</ul>'),
