(28292, 12104, '_flexible_content_blocks_1_block_heading', 'field_5c1ac7ff9a383'),
(28293, 12104, 'flexible_content_blocks_1_block_content', 'Our vision is to overcome the barriers to building top-performing teams, making it easier for organizations to scale their teams and achieve success. \r\n\r\nWe’re specialists who excel at creative team building and talent solutions, fully aware of how important it is to find the right talent. '),
