(28395, 12105, 'flexible_content_blocks_3_block_content', '<span style="font-weight: 400;">We’re a team of agency vets and creative leaders who develop simple, intelligent staffing solutions. We work tirelessly to solve the challenges of finding and managing creative talent, so you can focus on getting the job done right. Here’s a closer look at why our partners work with us:</span>'),
