(32547, 12250, 'flexible_content_blocks_0_column_1_content', '<h3>A simpler way to scale your creative and marketing teams</h3>\r\nAt Sandy, we help take the load off - bringing deep expertise from years of building high-performing creative teams for top brands and agencies, and applying it directly to your resourcing needs.\r\n\r\nWhat You Can Expect:\r\n<ul class="columns cols-2">\r\n 	<li>Trusted, Vetted Talent</li>\r\n 	<li>Less Admin, More Progress</li>\r\n 	<li>Support from Creative Specialists</li>\r\n 	<li>Flexible Solutions Built Around You</li>\r\n 	<li>A Team That Gets It</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nIf you’re ready, let’s get started!'),
