(35419, 12345, 'flexible_content_blocks_0_column_1_content', '<h4 style="text-align: left;">The AI Creative Impact Report</h4><br>\r\n<p style="text-align: left;">AI is already part of everyday creative work, but adoption is outpacing standards and training, widening the gap between leaders and talent. The AI Creative Impact Report shows where teams are today, where alignment breaks down, and how to close the gap without sacrificing creative quality.</p>\r\n<p style="text-align: left;">Share your contact info and we’ll send it when it’s ready.</p>'),
