(35451, 12346, '_flexible_content_blocks_0_column_1_heading', 'field_663a23ca43445'),
(35452, 12346, 'flexible_content_blocks_0_column_1_content', '<p data-start="0" data-end="179">AI is already part of everyday creative work, but a readiness gap is growing between leaders and talent as adoption moves faster than standards, training, and shared expectations.</p>\r\n<p data-start="181" data-end="423">The AI Creative Impact Report isn’t a tool review. It’s a clear look at where teams are today, where alignment is breaking down, and what it will take to bridge the gap, while protecting creative quality and the human value behind great work.</p>\r\n<p data-start="425" data-end="503" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Share your contact info below and we’ll send the report as soon as it’s ready.</p>'),
