(36057, 12366, '_flexible_content_blocks_0_column_1_heading', 'field_663a23ca43445'),
(36058, 12366, 'flexible_content_blocks_0_column_1_content', '<h4 style="text-align: left;">SIGNUP TODAY</h4>\r\n<h1 style="text-align: left;">The AI Creative Impact Report</h1>\r\n<p style="text-align: left;">AI is already part of everyday creative work, but adoption is outpacing standards, training, and shared expectations, creating a growing gap between leaders and talent.</p>\r\n<p style="text-align: left;">The AI Creative Impact Report isn’t a tool review. It shows where teams are today, where alignment breaks down, and how to close the gap without sacrificing creative quality.</p>\r\n<p style="text-align: left;">Share your contact info and we’ll send the report as soon as it’s ready.</p>'),
