(229, 1, '2024-05-13 23:15:55', '2024-05-13 23:15:55', '<h3><b>Introduction</b></h3>\r\n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Welcome to worksandy.com. We are dedicated to safeguarding your privacy and ensuring the protection of your personal information. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our www.worksandy.com and use our services. If you have any questions or concerns about our policy, please contact us at info@worksandy.com.</span>\r\n<h3><b>Information We Collect</b></h3>\r\n<span style="font-weight: 400;">We collect personal information that you voluntarily provide to us when registering on the website, expressing interest in obtaining information about us or our products and services, participating in activities on the website, or otherwise contacting us. This can include:</span>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Identity Data: Name, username, or similar identifiers.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Contact Data: Billing address, delivery address, email address, telephone numbers, social media handle.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Applicant Data: Gender, nationality, resume, work experience, rates.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Technical Data: Internet protocol (IP) address, browser type, internet service provider (ISP), referring/exit pages, operating system, date/time stamp, and clickstream data.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style="font-weight: 400;">We also collect data through cookies and similar technologies to understand how you use our website and to improve your experience.</span>\r\n<h3><b>Use of Your Information</b></h3>\r\n<span style="font-weight: 400;">We use the information we collect in the following ways:</span>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">To provide and manage services: Facilitating account creation, processing transactions, and providing customer support.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">To communicate with you: Sending administrative information, responding to inquiries, and providing updates on our services.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">To engage and onboard Sandy team members, and to match profiles to projects for our Customers.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">To improve our website and services: Analyzing trends, tracking user movements, and gathering demographic information to enhance our offerings.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">For marketing purposes: Sending promotional materials, newsletters, and information about our services, subject to your preferences.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><b>Sharing Your Information</b></h3>\r\n<span style="font-weight: 400;">We only share your information with third parties in the following circumstances:</span>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">With service providers: To perform functions on our behalf such as payment processing, data analysis, email delivery, hosting services, customer service, and marketing efforts.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">For legal reasons: To comply with legal obligations, respond to legal processes, and address violations of our policies.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">With your consent: When you provide explicit consent to share your information for a specific purpose.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><b>Data Security</b></h3>\r\n<span style="font-weight: 400;">We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, use, alteration, and disclosure. However, no method of transmission over the internet or electronic storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee its absolute security. You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your password and account information.</span>\r\n<h3><b>Your Privacy Rights</b></h3>\r\n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Depending on your location, you may have the following rights regarding your personal information:</span>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Access: Request access to your personal data and receive a copy of it.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Correction: Request correction of any inaccurate or incomplete data.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Deletion: Request deletion of your personal data, subject to certain exceptions.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Restriction: Request restriction of processing your personal data.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Objection: Object to the processing of your personal data.</span></li>\r\n 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Data Portability: Request the transfer of your personal data to another party.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style="font-weight: 400;">To exercise these rights, please contact us at info@worksandy.com</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">.</span>\r\n<h3><b>Cookies and Tracking Technologies</b></h3>\r\n<span style="font-weight: 400;">We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to collect and use personal information about you. This helps us understand and improve your user experience. You can control cookies through your browser settings and other tools. For detailed information on how we use cookies, please visit our Cookie Policy.</span>\r\n<h3><b>Updates to This Policy</b></h3>\r\n<span style="font-weight: 400;">We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page and updating the "Last Updated" date at the top. We encourage you to review this Privacy Policy periodically to stay informed about how we are protecting your information.</span>\r\n<h3><b>Contact Us</b></h3>\r\n<span style="font-weight: 400;">If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact us at:</span>\r\n\r\n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Work Sandy LLC</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">\r\n</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">1005 Marion Oak CT Altamonte Springs FL 32701</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">\r\n</span><a href="mailto:Info@worksandy.com"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Info@worksandy.com</span></a>', 'Privacy Policy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'privacy-policy', '', '', '2024-05-31 13:02:24', '2024-05-31 17:02:24', '', 0, 'http://work-sandy.local/?page_id=229', 0, 'page', '', 0),
