ut</a> - we’d love to chat.</span>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;', 'Talent Acquisition: Tips for Finding and Onboarding the Right Talent', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '12216-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-07-16 19:03:34', '2025-07-16 23:03:34', '', 12216, 'https://worksandy.com/?p=12243', 0, 'revision', '', 0) ;
INSERT INTO `ULhz1h_posts` ( `ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(12244, 5, '2025-08-05 12:12:00', '2025-08-05 16:12:00', 'This chart illustrates the decline in marketing budgets from 2022 to 2024, dropping from 9.5% to 7.7%. The data underscores growing ROI pressure on marketing teams, a key topic in optimizing talent, technology, and marketing strategies.', 'Budget Cuts Graph v1', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'budget-cuts-graph-v1', '', '', '2025-08-05 12:16:26', '2025-08-05 16:16:26', '', 12159, 'https://worksandy.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Budget-Cuts-Graph-v1.png', 0, 'attachment', 'image/png', 0),
(12245, 5, '2025-08-05 12:17:43', '2025-08-05 16:17:43', 'This 3D donut chart illustrates that 2 out of 3 CFOs are dissatisfied with marketing ROI, underscoring the growing pressure on marketing teams to deliver measurable financial results and justify budget spend.', 'ROI Reality Check Pie Chart v1', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'roi-reality-check-pie-chart-v1', '', '', '2025-08-05 12:20:29', '2025-08-05 16:20:29', '', 12159, 'https://worksandy.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/ROI-Reality-Check-Pie-Chart-v1.png', 0, 'attachment', 'image/png', 0),
(12246, 5, '2025-08-05 12:22:37', '2025-08-05 16:22:37', 'Visual checklist of five key realignment recommendations to improve marketing ROI: align to business goals, avoid low-impact work, choose the right KPIs, leverage technology for productivity, and optimize resources. From Sandy’s guide on optimizing talent, tech, and marketing ROI', 'Realignment Recommendations Checklist v5', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'realignment-recommendations-checklist-v5', '', '', '2025-08-05 12:24:04', '2025-08-05 16:24:04', '', 12159, 'https://worksandy.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Realignment-Recommendations-Checklist-v5.png', 0, 'attachment', 'image/png', 0),
(12247, 5, '2025-08-05 12:29:45', '2025-08-05 16:29:45', '<span style="font-weight: 400;">With Gartner noting a significant decrease in marketing budgets - from 9.1% of company revenue in 2023 to 7.7% in 2024 - teams are continuing to find themselves pressured to achieve more with less. This 15% drop is a clear indicator that marketing and creative departments must tighten their belts while still leveraging emerging technologies like AI, which present unique challenges and opportunities.</span>\r\n\r\n<img class="alignnone size-large wp-image-12244" src="https://worksandy.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Budget-Cuts-Graph-v1-1024x768.png" alt="Line graph showing marketing budget cuts from 2022 to 2024, decreasing from 9.5% in 2022 to 9.1% in 2023 and 7.7% in 2024, highlighting increased ROI pressure." width="1024" height="768" />\r\n\r\n<span style="font-weight: 400;">CFOs are taking a closer look at the ROI of marketing investments, with Gartner saying two-thirds are reporting that digital spending over the last three years hasn\'t met business expectations. At the same time, many marketing teams are intensely focused on capturing and reacting to customer signals, which often leads to tactics that customers find too intrusive, and ultimately prove to be counterproductive. The consequence? More expensive campaigns with diminishing returns, making it essential for these teams to realign their marketing efforts towards more valuable initiatives.</span>\r\n\r\n<img class="alignnone size-large wp-image-12245" src="https://worksandy.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/ROI-Reality-Check-Pie-Chart-v1-1024x768.png" alt="3D donut chart showing that two-thirds (2/3) of CFOs are dissatisfied with marketing ROI, highlighting a major challenge in aligning marketing performance with financial expectations." width="1024" height="768" />\r\n\r\n<span style="font-weight: 400;">In response, we encourage today’s creative and marketing leaders to:</span>\r\n\r\n<img class="alignnone size-large wp-image-12246" src="https://worksandy.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Realignment-Recommendations-Checklist-v5-1024x1024.png" alt="Infographic titled \'Realignment Recommendations\' listing five strategies for improving marketing ROI: 1) Align to business goals, 2) Say no to low-impact work, 3) Choose the right KPIs, 4) Use technology to boost productivity, and 5) Optimize resources. Created by Sandy." width="1024" height="1024" />\r\n\r\n<span style="font-weight: 400;">With the high costs of maintaining full-time teams, especially in slow periods, many creative and marketing teams are exploring AI solutions and flexible staffing models to stay agile. These strategies enable you to adjust team sizes according to immediate needs, optimizing costs and focusing on key projects that drive towards your business goals. This flexibility allows you to allocate essential internal resources towards long-term goals, manage costs, and still maintain creative output.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Consider the balancing act you face: managing resources to support other departments while prioritizing major initiatives like brand and product launches. By implementing flexible, reliable resourcing solutions, you can scale your workforce during peak times without the overhead of permanent positions, allowing you the flexibility to bring in specialized skills - think 3D designers, video editors, or creative technologists - on demand. This approach not only cuts down on long-term financial commitments but also allows you to explore new roles and discover how they can add value to your team over time.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style="font-weight: 400;">Effective resourcing strategies are essential, but integrating clever AI tools like <a href="https://celtra.com/">Celtra</a> for automating ad production, or <a href="https://www.iconik.io/">Ikonik</a> and <a href="https://www.lucidlink.com/">LucidLink</a> for efficient video asset management, can also improve your team\'s effectiveness. This strategy enables you to maintain a high level of creative output without stretching your resources too thin. It also simplifies the management of resource-intensive roles and ensures that your spending is in line with your strategic business goals and operational requirements.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style="font-weight: 400;">While AI tools and flexible staffing solutions might seem like a quick fix, they actually require thoughtful consideration to be effective. It\'s important to select the right partners and tools, whether they\'re creative resourcing specialists or enterprise-based AI production tools. Many large organizations already use contingent workforce solutions and large-scale staffing solutions, but working with experts who specialize in building flexible teams specifically designed for the future can help improve returns. These experts not only excel in identifying and vetting top talent but also understanding the unique traits and skills needed to meet your marketing and creative studios needs.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style="font-weight: 400;">At Sandy, we specialize in connecting exceptional creative talent with forward-thinking organizations, offering flexible staffing solutions that help teams thrive in today’s dynamic workplace. Our approach goes beyond just supplying great talent; we also handle talent onboarding, manage talent expectations, and ensure that new team members integrate smoothly into your organization. We manage communication, team expectations, and performance reviews, effectively lifting the burden off your shoulders so you can focus on getting the work done. We\'re incredibly proud of our success in filling flexible creative roles, and it\'s always exciting to see our elastic team talent frequently become valued full-time members.</span>\r\n\r\n<span style="font-weight: 400;">If this strikes a chord with you, we\'d love to <a href="https://worksandy.com/find-talent/">connect</a>! Feel free to <a href="https://worksandy.com/find-talent/">reach out</a> - we\'re eager to share our expertise and help you overcome the challenges of building a high-performing team that drives your business forward.</span>', 'Optimizing Talent, Tech, and Marketing ROI', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '12159-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-08-05 12:29:45', '2025-08-05 16:29:45', '', 12159, 'https://worksandy.com/?p=12247', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
